You should have reflection, or be fire/cold/shock resistant.  
Also, you should have means of emergency escape.  And finally 
note that you don't have to clear the room in one sweep.  
Stand on some stairs, and lure monsters which follow upstairs 
to deal with them separately.  If you're scared of being surrounded, 
use teleport and a /oDigging freely.  

